{
  "id": "piranport:portal_lectern",
  "items": [
    "piranport:dungeon_lectern",
    "piranport:dungeon_portal"
  ],
  "title": {
    "zh_cn": "皮兰港：副本传送门",
    "en_us": "Piran Port: Dungeon Portal"
  },
  "tags": [
    "piranport",
    "dungeon",
    "portal"
  ],
  "editable": false,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "portal_frame",
      "title": {
        "zh_cn": "门框与开口",
        "en_us": "Frame and Opening"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "type": "show_structure",
          "structure": "ponderer:basic"
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 20
        },
        {
          "type": "set_block",
          "block": "piranport:dungeon_portal",
          "blockPos": [
            1,
            1,
            2
          ],
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "传送门是多方块结构：用$(item)传送门框架$()围出一个门洞。框架外廓 4 宽 × 5 高，正面留出 2 宽 × 3 高的空洞。",
            "en_us": "The portal is a multiblock: build a doorway out of $(item)Portal Frame$() blocks. The frame is 4 wide × 5 tall, with a 2 wide × 3 tall opening at the front."
          },
          "point": [
            1.5,
            2.2,
            2.5
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        },
        {
          "type": "set_block",
          "block": "piranport:dungeon_portal",
          "blockPos": [
            2,
            1,
            2
          ],
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "set_block",
          "block": "piranport:dungeon_portal",
          "blockPos": [
            1,
            2,
            2
          ],
          "attachKeyFrame": false
        },
        {
          "type": "set_block",
          "block": "piranport:dungeon_portal",
          "blockPos": [
            2,
            2,
            2
          ],
          "attachKeyFrame": false
        },
        {
          "type": "set_block",
          "block": "piranport:dungeon_portal",
          "blockPos": [
            1,
            3,
            2
          ],
          "attachKeyFrame": false
        },
        {
          "type": "set_block",
          "block": "piranport:dungeon_portal",
          "blockPos": [
            2,
            3,
            2
          ],
          "attachKeyFrame": false
        },
        {
          "type": "set_block",
          "block": "piranport:dungeon_portal",
          "blockPos": [
            1,
            4,
            2
          ],
          "attachKeyFrame": false
        },
        {
          "type": "set_block",
          "block": "piranport:dungeon_portal",
          "blockPos": [
            2,
            4,
            2
          ],
          "attachKeyFrame": false
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "只有正面这一层是空的——门后有整整一层框架当背板。开口里必须保持空气，塞任何方块都会让门失效。",
            "en_us": "Only the front layer is hollow — there is a full layer of frame behind it. Keep the opening filled with air; any block inside disables the portal."
          },
          "point": [
            2.5,
            2.6,
            2.5
          ],
          "color": "input",
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lectern_linkage",
      "title": {
        "zh_cn": "讲台贴底边才生效",
        "en_us": "The Lectern Must Sit on the Bottom Edge"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "type": "show_structure",
          "structure": "ponderer:basic"
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 20
        },
        {
          "type": "set_block",
          "block": "piranport:dungeon_portal",
          "blockPos": [
            1,
            1,
            2
          ],
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "set_block",
          "block": "piranport:dungeon_portal",
          "blockPos": [
            2,
            1,
            2
          ],
          "attachKeyFrame": false
        },
        {
          "type": "set_block",
          "block": "piranport:dungeon_lectern",
          "blockPos": [
            1,
            1,
            1
          ],
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "blockProperties": {
            "facing": "south",
            "has_key": "true"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "$(item)海域出击书台$()必须紧贴门框底边外侧一格——门前、门后、左右或正下方都算。",
            "en_us": "$(item)Dungeon Lectern$() must sit one block outside the frame's bottom edge — front, back, left, right, or directly below all count."
          },
          "point": [
            1.5,
            0.6,
            1.5
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        },
        {
          "type": "indicate_success",
          "blockPos": [
            1,
            1,
            1
          ],
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "书台里必须插着$(item)副本钥匙$()。空书台不激活传送门——插钥匙时门框会立刻响应。",
            "en_us": "The lectern must hold a $(item)Dungeon Key$(). An empty lectern will not activate the portal — inserting the key lights it up immediately."
          },
          "point": [
            1.5,
            1.6,
            1.5
          ],
          "color": "green",
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "记不住位置的话，右键门框任意一块会提示你还缺什么。",
            "en_us": "If unsure, right-click any frame block — it will tell you what is still missing."
          },
          "point": [
            2.5,
            2.2,
            3.5
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "walk_in",
      "title": {
        "zh_cn": "走进传送门",
        "en_us": "Walk Into the Portal"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "type": "show_structure",
          "structure": "ponderer:basic"
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 20
        },
        {
          "type": "set_block",
          "block": "piranport:dungeon_portal",
          "blockPos": [
            1,
            1,
            2
          ],
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "set_block",
          "block": "piranport:dungeon_lectern",
          "blockPos": [
            1,
            1,
            1
          ],
          "attachKeyFrame": false,
          "blockProperties": {
            "facing": "south",
            "has_key": "true"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "框架完整、底边挂着插钥匙的书台，传送门就常开——直接走进开口即可进入副本，不需要任何右键操作。",
            "en_us": "With a complete frame and a keyed lectern on the bottom edge, the portal stays open — simply walk into the opening to enter. No right-click needed."
          },
          "point": [
            1.5,
            2.2,
            1.5
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        },
        {
          "type": "indicate_success",
          "blockPos": [
            1,
            1,
            2
          ],
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "首次进入会从关卡起点开局；已经有进度则接着上次的节点继续。多人各自开门、各自进本，互不强制组队。",
            "en_us": "First entry starts at the stage's beginning; an existing run resumes at its current node. Players enter independently — no forced party."
          },
          "point": [
            1.5,
            2.6,
            2.5
          ],
          "color": "green",
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "想直接回起点或续用最新记录点，就右键书台打开出击界面选择。",
            "en_us": "To jump to the stage start or resume from your latest checkpoint, right-click the lectern to open the sortie screen."
          },
          "point": [
            1.5,
            0.6,
            1.5
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
